  "live_records": {
    "q-64680": {
      "dom_id": "step-q64680",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Find the curvature at an arbitrary point on the curve $r(t)=⟨\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t,\\,t⟩.$",
      "worked_solution": "Let $T(t)$ denote the unit tangent to the given curve as a function of the parameter $t.$ Since we are given the curve $r(t)$ parametrized by the parameter $t$ (not the arc length $s$), we will use the following formula for the curvature:\n\n$$\nκ(t)=\\frac{‖{T}^{′}(t)‖}{‖{r}^{′}(t)‖}\n$$\n\nNow, we calculate ${r}^{′}(t)$ and find its magnitude:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t,\\,-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t,\\,1⟩ \\\\ ‖{r}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{{(3\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t)}^{2}+{(-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t)}^{2}+{(1)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9({cos}^{2}⁡(3t)+{sin}^{2}⁡(3t))+1} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{10}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the corresponding unit tangent vector is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(t) & =\\frac{{r}^{′}(t)}{‖{r}^{′}(t)‖} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}⟨3\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t,\\,-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t,\\,1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we calculate ${T}^{′}(t)$ and find its magnitude:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1)⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}⟨-9\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t,\\,-9\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t,\\,0⟩ \\\\ ‖{T}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}\\sqrt{(9\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t)^{2}+(-9\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)^{2}+{0}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}\\sqrt{{9}^{2}({sin}^{2}⁡3t+{cos}^{2}⁡3t)} \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{\\sqrt{10}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the curvature is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}κ(t) & =\\frac{‖{T}^{′}(t)‖}{‖{r}^{′}(t)‖}=\\frac{\\,\\frac{9}{\\sqrt{10}}\\,}{\\sqrt{10}}=\\frac{9}{10}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
